        "tree_id": "bea4cfd70f0d3ea56c9b81350437167f2b55a532",
        "message": "Clarify the career quiz's age field: label, placeholder, and helper text\n\n\"ასაკი / კლასი\" was ambiguous — typing \"12\" could mean 12 years old or\n12th grade (a 17-18-year-old), two very different ages that would route to\ncompletely different question sets (kid vs adult) and AI report tones.\nRelabeled to \"ასაკი (წლები)\" with a \"მაგ. 14\" placeholder and an explicit\n\"მიუთითეთ ასაკი წლებში (არა კლასი)\" helper line underneath, so there's no\nambiguity about which number the field wants.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:25:38Z",
