      "head_commit": {
        "id": "b888bcc4c32ca3f416d2fa657f7cb167eecbbd3e",
        "tree_id": "df08ef96965467576f378bf7693c7caf4c0108c6",
        "message": "Career quiz: multi-select answers, homepage banner overlap fix\n\nMulti-select quiz answers:\n- career-test.tsx's quiz questions now render as checkboxes instead of\n  radio buttons — a user can select one or several options per question,\n  and \"შედეგის მიღება\" enables as soon as every question has at least one\n  selection (not exactly one).\n- The submission payload sends each question's full list of selections\n  instead of a single string; Backend's answersSchema now accepts either a\n  plain string or a string[] per question, and the AI prompt's Q&A\n  transcript joins a multi-select answer with \", \" so Gemini synthesizes\n  across all of them — verified live with a genuinely mixed-selection\n  submission (multiple work styles + multiple career goals at once), which\n  produced a materially richer, hybrid recommendation than any single\n  answer would have.\n\nHomepage banner overlap fix:\n- The promo section's `-mt-4` was pulling it up far enough to overlap the\n  gallery section's \"See All Photos\" link right above it. Replaced with\n  `mt-16 mb-16` for real separation on both sides.\n- Subtitle text now uses explicit light/dark colors (was a fixed\n  text-slate-400) — the card's translucent gradient reads as a pale wash\n  over a light background in light mode, which made the old fixed gray\n  low-contrast there specifically.\n\nAlso fixed a real production incident hit while working on this: the\nBackend went briefly unresponsive after its last deploy (a fresh container\nthat started cleanly per its own logs, then stopped responding to\nrequests) — resolved with a restart and confirmed healthy on the correct\nimage before starting this change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:08:03Z",
        "author": {
          "name": "iako-digital",
          "email": "iakodigital@gmail.com"
        },
